    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "内部结构框图"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                102,
                139,
                248,
                160
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/2eed823add47d9068d0a4a1e9dceacc588a6dc750966d89685e721c648c3d8cc.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "图 3 BP5131JA 部框图"
                    }
                ],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                172,
                892,
                498
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "应用信息"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                550,
                200,
                570
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5131JA 是一款高精度单段线性恒流 LED 控制芯片，主要用于驱动由市电供电的高电压、低电流LED 灯串。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                97,
                579,
                484,
                633
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1 供电"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                645,
                159,
                661
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在系统上电后，D 端通过内部的高压 JFET 给芯片供电，当D端的电压超过10V之后芯片开始工作。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                671,
                482,
                707
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2 恒流控制，输出电流设置"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                719,
                319,
                734
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5131JA可以通过外部电阻精确设定 LED电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                746,
                470,
                763
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "LED 导通时，输出电流计算公式："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                775,
                356,
                791
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "I _ {L E D} = \\frac {V r e f}{R c s}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/8477313e4ec6d3facc20f786f318dd07f747dab0f77d85a76cd935d95e9efaa0.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                173,
                802,
                273,
                837
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "由于散热能力的限制，在220V市电输入时，建议将LED电流设在40mA以下；在110V市电输入时，建议将 LED电流设在60mA以下。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                839,
                482,
                892
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3 过温调节功能"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                539,
                640,
                557
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5131JA 具有过热调节功能，在驱动电源过热时逐渐减小输出电流，从而控制输出功率和温升，使电源温度保持在设定值，以提高系统的可靠性。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                565,
                897,
                620
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "过热调节温度为芯片内部设定值(参照电气参数表)。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                631,
                895,
                665
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PCB 设计"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                677,
                586,
                694
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在设计BP5131JA的PCB板时，需要注意以下事项："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                705,
                894,
                722
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "地线"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                733,
                554,
                749
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "电流采样电阻的功率地线尽可能短。GND的面积要尽可能大，以减小热阻，增强散热能力。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                760,
                895,
                796
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "芯片散热片"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                807,
                608,
                824
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5131JA 芯片底部有增强散热能力的散热片，在芯片内部已经连接到 GND 引脚。在设计 PCB 时，将散热片连接到 PCB 的地。为了达到良好的散热效果，需要将散热片连接的PCB铜皮面积尽量大。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                835,
                897,
                908
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
